-- allium: 4
-- Relies on the lock ALONE keeping its writes fresh — the classic wrong assumption. The lock guarantees
-- exclusivity of the grant, NOT that a stale holder never writes; that is what fencing tokens are for. The
-- rely is NOT discharged: the deep distributed-locking bug, caught from the reliance side.
use "lock_guarantees.allium"
component AssumesFreshness
  entity Client
  observable state granted(Client) : bool
  observable state fresh(Client) : bool
  rely needs_freshness means granted(c) implies fresh(c)
end
